Package: springs
Type: Package
Title: gemtc-Compatible Network Meta-Analysis via the Spring/Grand-Canonical Engine
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Thodoris", "Papakonstantinou", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "antrcl@tpapak.com")
Description: A drop-in replacement for the Bayesian network meta-analysis API of
    'gemtc', backed by the verified spring / Grand-Canonical (GC) engine
    (Rust). Provides mtc.network(), mtc.model(), mtc.run() and the result
    accessors relative.effect(), relative.effect.table(), summary() and
    rank.probability(), returning objects shaped like 'gemtc''s so that
    consumers such as MetaInsight work by swapping the 'gemtc::' namespace for
    'springs::'. The engine produces a closed-form joint posterior (no MCMC) of
    the basic treatment contrasts and the heterogeneity SD; this package samples
    that posterior to reproduce all-pairwise league tables and rank
    probabilities the way 'gemtc' derives them from chains.
License: AGPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.0)
Imports:
    jsonlite
Suggests:
    gemtc,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
